            </h3>
            <p>
              The official YouTube banner background size is <strong>2560 × 1440 pixels</strong> (16:9 aspect ratio) with a 6 MB maximum file size. YouTube Studio enforces an absolute minimum upload dimension of <strong>2048 × 1152 pixels</strong>. While creators frequently search for <strong>1024 × 576 pixels</strong>, YouTube automatically rejects 1024 × 576 images because they fall below the required minimum resolution, even though they share the identical 16:9 widescreen proportion.
            </p>
            <p>
              If your original artwork, cool wallpaper, or anime illustration is currently 1024 × 576, you must upscale or place it onto a 2560 × 1440 canvas before uploading to YouTube Studio. For full sizing rules, consult our in-depth <a href="/guides/youtube-banner-size" class="text-accent underline font-medium hover:text-accent-600">YouTube banner size guide</a> and our step-by-step tutorial on <a href="/guides/youtube-banner-1024-x-576" class="text-accent underline font-medium hover:text-accent-600">fixing 1024×576 banner upload errors</a>.
            </p>

